2771b3892515/ss_952f6b0653bc695f629759f6ade52771b3892515.600x338.jpg?t=1759310628"}],"short_description":"Live your best squirrel life. Explore, gather, craft, and build incredible treehouses in acres of beautiful parkland. Scurry across lawns, up trees, and leap limb to limb solo, or up to four friends can play together in co-op. Endless summer days of adventure await.","steam_appid":2977620,"support_info":{"email":"publishing@amplifiergameinvest.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean","type":"game","website":"https://squirreledaway.com"}